msgstr "Gespäicherten API-Schlëssel läschen"

#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"E Schlëssel ass verschlësselt gespäichert. Fir en ze behalen, eidel loossen, "
"oder e neien Schlëssel aginn fir en z'ersetzen. De gespäicherte Wäert kann "
"net ugeewise ginn."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Nëmmen eng Kéier aginn, verschlësselt gespäichert, a kann net nach eng Kéier "
"ugeewise ginn. Eidel loossen fir OPENROUTER_API_KEY / "
"settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY'] ze benotzen."

#: admin.py:216
msgid "API key status"
msgstr "Status vum API-Schlëssel"

